        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-207, Fanciful Swirl Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Swirl Cabinet Knob is reminiscent of natural themes and brings a warmth with it. It is available in 6 finishes including antique english (pictured) and polished brass. We imagine this knob on dark wood cabinets for a rustic look; but certainly this Swirled Cabinet Pull will look great amid most decors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/swirl-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-407\"><b>CP-407 Swirl Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-207 Swirled Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CP-407-finishes.jpg?v=1704354714\" width=\"575\" height=\"114\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
